# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Helper function for running circuits {#helper-function-for-running-circuits}"
msgstr ""
"Función auxiliar para ejecutar Circuits {#helper-function-for-running-"
"circuits}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's define a helper function that handles the process of running a "
"quantum circuit and retrieving measurement results. This function takes care"
" of transpiling the circuit to match the backend's instruction set, running "
"it through a `Sampler` primitive, and extracting the counts from the "
"results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahora definamos una función auxiliar que maneja el proceso de ejecutar un "
"circuito cuántico y recuperar los resultados de medición. Esta función se "
"encarga de transpilar el circuito para que coincida con el conjunto de "
"instrucciones del backend, ejecutarlo a través de una primitiva `Sampler`, y"
" extraer los conteos de los resultados.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run on a QPU and visualize results {#run-on-a-qpu-and-visualize-results}"
msgstr ""
"Ejecutar en una QPU y visualizar los resultados {#run-on-a-qpu-and-"
"visualize-results}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, we run the circuit on an IBM quantum processing unit (QPU) in the "
"cloud for 1000 shots and plot the results. IBM QPUs are physical systems "
"that can pick up noise, so gates are slightly imperfect, measurements can be"
" wrong sometimes, and device calibration drifts over time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, ejecutamos el circuito en una unidad de procesamiento cuántico "
"(QPU) de IBM en la nube para 1000 shots y graficamos los resultados. Las QPU"
" de IBM son sistemas físicos que pueden captar ruido, por lo que las puertas"
" son ligeramente imperfectas, las mediciones a veces pueden ser incorrectas "
"y la calibración del dispositivo se desvía (deriva) con el tiempo.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Running on real quantum computers also introduces practical considerations. "
"Jobs can sit in a queue, because many people may be using the same device. "
"You also have to choose a shot count that balances statistical "
"considerations (more shots equals a higher signal-to-noise ratio) with "
"time/cost constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
